WEBVTT

00:00:00.324 --> 00:00:03.714
Your <b>customer directory</b>, with what each one buys

00:00:03.777 --> 00:00:06.926
<b>Con saldo</b> (with balance) shows only the ones who owe you

00:00:07.014 --> 00:00:10.485
See how much they owe, since when, and their last payment

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:15.142
Download their <b>account statement</b> as an image to send it on WhatsApp

00:00:15.216 --> 00:00:18.526
And in <b>Historial</b> (history), all their purchases

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:24.943
Each ticket with what they took, their payments and what is left to collect
